Bug ID: BUG-004

Bug Title: Medication stock not updated after dispensing medication

Environment: Web Browser (Chrome)

Precondition:
   - Medication stock is available in the system

Steps to reproduce: 
   1. Navigate to "Walk-In Dispense" page
   2. Select patient
   3. Select medication to dispense
   4. Click "Dispense" 

Expected Results:
   - Medication is dispensed successfully
   - Medication status is updated to "Dispensed"
   - Medication stock decreases accordingly
   - A "Ready for Collection" email is sent to the patient

Actual Results:
   - Medication is dispensed successfully 
   - Medication status is updated to "Dispensed"
   - Medication stock remains unchanged
   - A "Ready for Collection" email is sent to the patient

Severity: High
Priority: P2

Evidence: To be provided
